sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WS as Warehouse Staff
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    actor TECH as Technician App

    WS->>API: Initiate Transfer (Router SN, Technician ID)
    API->>DB: Validate Router Status ("IN_WAREHOUSE")
    DB-->>API: Validated
    API->>DB: Create Transfer Record (Status: "PENDING_ACCEPTANCE")
    API-->>TECH: Send Push Notification (Pending Asset Transfer)
    
    TECH->>API: Accept Hardware Transfer (Scan QR / Confirm)
    API->>DB: Update Router (holder_id = TECH.id, status = "WITH_TECH")
    API->>DB: Update Transfer Record (Status: "ACCEPTED")
    API-->>WS: Transfer Complete Confirmation